  "uzly {@0}.": "düğümler {@0}.",
  "{@0} $|(x-x_0)(x-x_1)|={@1}\\cdot {@2}={@3}$. Odhad chyby: $\\frac{{@4}}{2}\\cdot {@5}\\approx {@6}$.": "{@0} $|(x-x_0)(x-x_1)|={@1}\\cdot {@2}={@3}$. Hata kestirimi: $\\frac{{@4}}{2}\\cdot {@5}\\approx {@6}$.",
  "{@0}-krát": "{@0} kat",
